Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:02.02,0:00:04.36,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,We, the Rising Voltteccers,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.36,0:00:09.49,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,{\q2}have come to the Kitakami hamlet for the first time in a while, \N because there’s going to be a festival! {closer-to-TL ALT: because they’re having a festival!}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.49,0:00:11.37,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Isn’t that{it} just so {\i1}exciting?{\i0} {TL: I’m so excited! / Doesn't that make you look forward to it!}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.12,0:00:15.37,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Okay, you’re all set.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.37,0:00:17.25,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Yeah. You look good!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.59,0:00:28.09,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.14,0:00:33.64,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,It looks great on you!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.64,0:00:35.52,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Navi, you look lovely!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.39,0:00:39.69,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hmph! Dolling yourself up \N and gettin’ all giddy...{hashagu - hyper in 144, frolic etc}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.69,0:00:41.02,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What a little kid!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.02,0:00:42.90,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m not a little kid!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.90,0:00:44.77,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Plus {\i1}you{\i0} got dressed up too, Ult!{[you say that] Despite you having changed clothes too, Ult!}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.23,0:00:47.32,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,{\i1}I{\i0} ain’t all giddy about it!{hashagu}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.32,0:00:49.32,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yes, you are!{hashagu}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.78,0:00:52.82,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,There they go again...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.66,0:00:57.62,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Take care and have fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.00,0:01:00.71,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Enjoy the festival, you hear?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.68,0:01:13.14,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.14,0:01:14.18,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.18,0:01:20.73,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,The Kitakami hamlet’s festivals \N sure get you excited, don’t they?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.73,0:01:23.94,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I ain’t excited or anything, y’hear?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.57,0:01:34.91,Main,Man,0,0,0,,A big winner!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.66,0:01:37.58,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You did it, Masquernya!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.04,0:01:40.75,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,All right, me too!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.75,0:01:42.08,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Give it your best shot!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.25,0:01:43.83,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.71,0:01:48.00,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Aww...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.72,0:01:53.01,Main,Man,0,0,0,,A big winner!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.01,0:01:54.93,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ooh! Amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.93,0:01:55.60,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.60,0:01:56.72,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.39,0:02:00.68,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,That... wasn’t Loudbone, was it?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.85,0:02:03.52,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.52,0:02:04.40,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.40,0:02:06.36,Main,Roy Navi,0,0,0,,That kid?
Comment: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:08.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:38.82,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.21,0:03:55.34,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Awright!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.39,0:04:00.72,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.47,0:04:03.81,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,One more try!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.47,0:04:06.98,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Good position, good angle...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.98,0:04:09.85,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Just make sure the string doesn’t get wet...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.90,0:04:14.86,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.86,0:04:15.74,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.28,0:04:21.24,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wha...?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.24,0:04:22.53,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Oh! It’s you from before!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.08,0:04:34.55,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Everyone! \N I bought you candy apples!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.55,0:04:36.67,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Here, have some!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.05,0:04:42.14,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And here, one for Metamon, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.43,0:04:46.85,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Where’s Navi’s?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.85,0:04:47.68,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.14,0:04:50.52,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I was sure I bought enough...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.94,0:04:53.77,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.19,0:04:56.94,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Oh! You again!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.94,0:04:59.90,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Give Navi’s candy apple back!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.41,0:05:06.41,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Mmph! Hah! Guh! Gah!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.33,0:05:09.08,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Argh!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.41,0:05:11.54,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ahh! A big candy apple!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.59,0:05:24.51,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Oh... Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.85,0:05:32.73,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Liko, can I go play with that kid?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.73,0:05:35.44,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Sure, just don’t go too far.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.44,0:05:36.69,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.91,0:05:46.45,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.45,0:05:49.95,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Navi said she was going to play \N with the kid wearing an oni{ogre} mask.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.33,0:05:53.17,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Huh, so she made a friend...?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.75,0:05:57.92,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Welcome, Rising Voltteccers.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.09,0:06:05.64,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seille!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.01,0:06:10.39,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait for me!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.15,0:06:17.15,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You wanna play, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.69,0:06:19.82,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Then you mustn’t be mean!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.70,0:06:24.32,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Here, have this!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.29,0:06:35.96,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Let’s play together!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.21,0:06:41.92,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,It’s been a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.92,0:06:45.84,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,I’ve heard about what you’ve been up to.{I've heard of your exploits.} \N You have done well for yourselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.84,0:06:48.47,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Thank you for the training \N back then, Seille!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.47,0:06:51.60,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,I-It’s not like \N I did anything special...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.35,0:06:54.23,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,And m-more importantly...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.10,0:07:00.02,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Rising Voltteccers! If you’re here \N for a festival, you had better be ready!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.23,0:07:02.40,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.40,0:07:04.11,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,What now, all of a sudden...?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.99,0:07:07.37,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Don’t expect me to believe \N you’ve {\i1}forgotten!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.37,0:07:10.83,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,During the last festival, \N at the hands of one of {\i1}you{\i} people, I was...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.83,0:07:12.37,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Grrr...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.12,0:07:17.42,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Yabasocha!{069}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.76,0:07:25.01,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Ah, now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.01,0:07:28.64,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,So you got thrashed \N by Friede and want revenge?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.64,0:07:30.72,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Talk about misblaming...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.39,0:07:35.89,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,That’s enough! Now get ready! \N We’re heading {\i1}straight{\i0} for a showdown!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.39,0:07:38.56,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ooh, just what I wanted!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.56,0:07:41.27,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I can’t sit quiet \N when I hear the word “showdown”!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.11,0:07:49.41,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Twenty-eight, twenty-nine, thirty!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.87,0:07:53.16,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,All right! Where could they be?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.43,0:08:10.43,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.23,0:08:20.56,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Found... you!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.57,0:08:24.78,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh? It’s just the mask?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.57,0:08:28.32,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ahh...!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.12,0:08:32.91,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I got tricked!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.91,0:08:35.08,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.96,0:08:39.08,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.58,0:08:41.17,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.17,0:08:42.84,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh-huh-huh-huh-huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.71,0:08:47.09,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You’re a Pokémon?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.85,0:08:55.35,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hyah!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.35,0:08:57.48,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hup! Hup!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.48,0:08:59.85,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ha! Hup! Ha!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.48,0:09:05.15,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That was amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.15,0:09:07.11,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,You’re great at this, Ult!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.57,0:09:09.74,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Buh!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.74,0:09:13.62,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Ah! Guh! Gah! Gah!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.66,0:09:20.66,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Looks like {\i1}I’m{\i0} the winner here.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.42,0:09:24.38,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Grrr...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.38,0:09:27.13,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,We’ve barely gotten started!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.48,0:09:43.48,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That’s so funny!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.48,0:09:45.06,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Then lemme try, too!{I from Navi}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.57,0:09:48.98,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon! \N Transform into the mask!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.29,0:10:01.79,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Boo!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.50,0:10:05.46,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Nyah!{142 (nyah-nyah)}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.92,0:10:09.09,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Mon.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.56,0:10:26.61,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.61,0:10:29.19,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wow, those are some skills!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.19,0:10:30.94,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Awesome as usual, Dot!{Sasuga. line}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.94,0:10:34.20,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Grrr...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.20,0:10:36.45,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,This wasn’t supposed to be...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.46,0:10:51.46,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,The one right on the edge?{The most to the side?} \N Then I’ll say... Middle one!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.46,0:10:53.26,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Now, which was it?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.22,0:10:58.47,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ah, you were {\i1}that{\i0} one, huh?{Oh, so you were that one?}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.68,0:11:04.94,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Agh, Metamon’s \N “Which-One-Am-I?” quizzes are tough!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.40,0:11:11.53,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.28,0:11:17.28,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You wanna play over there? Sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.28,0:11:19.37,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Whatcha wanna play? \N Whatcha wanna play?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.17,0:11:30.00,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,{You’re }Always on point, Masquernya!{Sasuga. line}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.05,0:11:32.71,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Grrr...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.71,0:11:34.84,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You still wanna keep going?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.84,0:11:36.68,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Bah! Obviously, yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.68,0:11:39.18,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,I couldn’t possibly back down now!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.97,0:11:42.72,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Can’t knock her fighting spirit, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.97,0:11:45.56,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Just you watch!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.56,0:11:47.98,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Old man! Gimme all your rings!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.94,0:11:49.98,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.90,0:11:52.61,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Hah! Eh! Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.86,0:11:56.45,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Oh dear...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.41,0:12:00.07,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.16,0:12:06.46,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Navi?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.62,0:12:10.42,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What’s she doin’?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.42,0:12:12.42,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,She just went into the woods...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.88,0:12:15.34,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’s too dangerous for them{Navi-tachi} \N to go in there alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.34,0:12:16.51,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Let’s follow her!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.38,0:12:20.18,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What, seriously?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.76,0:12:25.10,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Hah! Hah! Hah!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.10,0:12:26.98,Main,Man,0,0,0,,A big miss!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.44,0:12:29.94,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Grrr...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.94,0:12:32.86,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,One more round! \N Rising Voltteccers!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.98,0:12:35.78,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Huh?
Comment: 0,0:12:41.49,0:12:41.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part C}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.71,0:12:49.50,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.63,0:12:53.59,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hold it, hold it!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.04,0:12:55.63,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You’re it!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.88,0:13:00.68,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hey, no fair!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.51,0:13:06.47,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.48,0:13:11.69,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.27,0:13:14.06,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.69,0:13:16.36,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What’s all this?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.24,0:13:26.20,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.46,0:13:33.67,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Navi’s not here...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.51,0:13:40.72,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Did you find something, \N Masquernya?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.51,0:13:44.43,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,A huge tree...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.43,0:13:46.18,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,What is this...?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.56,0:13:53.73,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Seems like it’s Kitakami’s Big Tree.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.73,0:13:58.65,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It says they offer food \N and masks here at festival times.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.11,0:14:01.53,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,These are offerings?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.53,0:14:03.99,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Don’t they look a bit... half-eaten?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.99,0:14:07.03,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,And those do seem to be masks, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.96,0:14:13.54,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Pokémon footprints?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.12,0:14:15.79,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Isn’t that mask...?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.67,0:14:20.96,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Wh-What’s that?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.01,0:14:24.55,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,A candy apple...?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.94,0:14:37.90,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.36,0:14:40.90,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.69,0:14:45.86,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,Kamitsuorochi. Apple Serpent Pokémon. \N Grass/Dragon type.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.86,0:14:49.95,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,Seven inserpents{apparently serpent+bug, ENgame: syrpent} live inside \N an apple made of syrup.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.95,0:14:52.16,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,The inserpent in the center \N is the commander.{Scarlet dex entry}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.16,0:14:54.42,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,There’s seven of those in there?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.42,0:14:56.29,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’s a rare Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.29,0:15:00.71,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I’ve heard that, aside from the head one \N and the two that help it move around,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.71,0:15:03.59,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,the inserpents are usually asleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.30,0:15:08.68,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I get it! This’s what broke the masks \N and ate the food, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.68,0:15:09.60,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.53,0:15:25.65,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Everyone, watch out!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.65,0:15:27.70,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That’s a sweet, pleasant scent...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.70,0:15:31.03,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,That must be \N the ability Sweet Nectar{mitsu}.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.04,0:15:39.38,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Looks like it’s not gonna \N let us get away!{Sweet Nectar lowers evasion}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.38,0:15:41.63,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,For now, let’s calm it down.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.63,0:15:44.34,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya! \N Stop it moving with your vine!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.10,0:16:00.52,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.53,0:16:05.36,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wanival! Air Cutter!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.62,0:16:17.37,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Good job, Loudbone!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.37,0:16:19.21,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Now! Air Cutter!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.13,0:16:26.88,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yamirami, use Shadow Strike!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.43,0:16:38.94,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.78,0:16:54.99,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,What’s that...?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.99,0:16:55.95,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Gah...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.95,0:16:58.66,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Looks like we woke up \N the sleeping inserpents inside!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.72,0:17:11.09,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yamirami, run for it!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.60,0:17:14.81,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wanival!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.64,0:17:21.52,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Whoa-oa!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.86,0:17:28.86,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.86,0:17:29.61,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wha—?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.87,0:17:35.74,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Why’s everyone here?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.00,0:17:40.79,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I dunno, but it seems like \N they’re in trouble!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.79,0:17:43.63,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,All right... Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.14,0:17:55.26,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.44,0:18:06.06,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.06,0:18:07.94,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,They’re acting kinda weird.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.94,0:18:09.82,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Squabbling amongst themselves?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.44,0:18:13.20,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,One, two, three...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.66,0:18:15.99,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Huh? There’s one more than before.{like 139 mice}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.99,0:18:16.99,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Wha...?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.41,0:18:18.70,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.70,0:18:19.87,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,He-heh!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.20,0:18:22.29,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.29,0:18:23.92,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,All thanks to Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.79,0:18:27.29,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That was Operation: \N Metamon’s “Which-One-Am-I?” Quiz!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.29,0:18:28.09,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Metamon?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.09,0:18:32.80,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I get it! Metamon transformed \N into an inserpent and confused{same word as the status} them?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.80,0:18:34.34,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That’s incredible, Navi.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.22,0:18:42.89,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That’s not good! \N They figured it out!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.89,0:18:44.10,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon, run for it!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.37,0:19:04.87,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.23,0:19:26.73,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You did it, Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.86,0:19:39.12,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.37,0:19:46.00,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.26,0:20:04.02,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,So wait, it was just hungry?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.39,0:20:07.77,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Maybe it was mad \N it couldn’t find the offerings.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.19,0:20:11.52,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,So it wasn’t the one \N who took the food...?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.15,0:20:17.28,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,None of those footprints \N look like Kamitsuorochi’s, either.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.95,0:20:25.58,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What, again?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.29,0:20:33.04,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What even was that thing...?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.34,0:20:39.47,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,{\q2}That’s Ogrepon. \N A Pokémon that used to dwell in the Kitakami hamlet.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.47,0:20:40.47,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You know about it?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.47,0:20:41.55,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.55,0:20:47.10,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Once, the village feared Ogrepon \N as a mountain-dwelling oni{ogre}.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.10,0:20:48.35,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,That little thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.35,0:20:49.81,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.81,0:20:52.90,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. \N Just a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.90,0:20:56.69,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,She found a partner, \N and we learned that it’s a kindly Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.15,0:21:01.07,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Right? ‘Cause Ogrepon’s really nice!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.07,0:21:03.49,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Oh... This little one is Navi.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.49,0:21:06.41,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,A new member of \N the Rising Voltteccers.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.41,0:21:07.87,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.87,0:21:10.04,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.04,0:21:12.58,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Then let’s have a showdown, \N right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.58,0:21:16.13,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Ring-toss, water gun, \N candy cutting, anything you want!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.84,0:21:19.22,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ooh! That sounds fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.22,0:21:20.22,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.22,0:21:21.93,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Even Navi...?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.93,0:21:23.22,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,She never learns.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.22,0:21:30.02,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Hmm... But then who exactly {\i1}did{\i0} \N steal the offerings and break the masks...?
Comment: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie A}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.58,0:21:48.20,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Friede here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.20,0:21:51.87,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s time to Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.34,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Today’s topic is Ogrepon!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.34,0:21:58.55,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s a Pokémon that changes type \N by changing its mask,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.55,0:22:02.55,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,but do you know \N which type’s power it can draw on?{Water type, Fire type, Rock type}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.18,0:22:06.47,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See the answer after the commercials!
Comment: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Ending}
Comment: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie B}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.65,0:23:42.48,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Time to announce \N the correct answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.48,0:23:43.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.86,0:23:45.11,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,All of them!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.61,0:23:49.32,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,While fighting, it draws upon \N the type energy stored in its masks!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:53.04,0:23:54.62,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.46,0:23:58.42,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,So you can transform, too!
Comment: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:00.50,0:24:04.01,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,The festival’s still got way more to go! \N At night, there’s bon dancing!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:04.01,0:24:06.17,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,And don’t forget about \N your showdown with me!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:06.17,0:24:09.59,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,But we still haven’t found \N the Pokémon that messed up the offerings...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.59,0:24:12.51,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Big trouble, guys! \N Pokémon are rampaging at the festival!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.51,0:24:14.93,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,No, inconceivable! The Comraddies?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.93,0:24:15.73,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,The Comraddies?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:15.73,0:24:18.23,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,A-ha! Well, I {\i1}suppose{\i0} \N I could fill you in, as a special favor.{overbearing smarmy 'well then let me teach you what you obviously don't know'}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.23,0:24:18.73,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,They’re—
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.73,0:24:21.98,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And so, to be continued \N next time on Pocket Monsters!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:21.98,0:24:24.90,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,The Comraddies Attack! Momowarou’s Decision!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:24.90,0:24:27.53,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Hold on! Let me explain it!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:28.41,0:24:30.45,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh? Momowarou?
